#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax tastatūra"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Tastatūra,<br><em>karaļa cienīga.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr "Ātra kā Anax – karaliskā dižspāre.<br>Precīza kā tās medības."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Swype iedvesmota. Dzimusi kā Swajp.</strong> Android tastatūra, kurā raksti, vienkārši velkot pirkstu. Tā min vārdus pēc konteksta, mācās tavu stilu, un visi tavi dati paliek tālrunī."

#: index
msgid "Get it on Google Play"
msgstr "Iegūt Google Play"

